    "said": [
     "The final dataset includes 4995 species occurrence records for 131 species across 917 sites and 86 years (1663 combinations of sites and years).",
     "We excluded all sites hosting only 1 species (i.e., not hosting an Odonata multispecies community), ![Image block](doc:ae11e86/tier:advanced/page:3/block:8) flowchart ```mermaid graph TD A[\"Functional Traits\"] --> B[\"Machine Learning\"] C[\"Biotic Interactions\"] --> D[\"Residual Co-occurrence\"] E[\"Occurrences\"] --> F[\"Co-occurrences\"] G[\"Environmental Factors\"] --> H[\"Joint Species Distribution Models\"] I[\"Data\"] --> J[\"Statistical tool\"] K[\"Influences\"] --> L[\"Predicts\"] ``` F I G U R E 2 Diagram showing the logic behind our analytical framework."
    ]
   },
